WEBVTT

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:04.980
It appears that all the chaos of 
this afternoon has finally settled.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:10.120
Yeah. Lady Skadi truly is the 
central figure of this city.

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:15.240
It's been so long since we were last here.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:18.240
Probably since we opened up the clinic.

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:21.860
But it's unbelievable.

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.360
You're the one who arrived on the scene,

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.900
and yet, no one will tell you 
how Lady Skadi is doing.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.790
It's not surprising. 
Her primary physician is Dr. Cthulhy,

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:34.660
and she's not obligated to tell us.

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:38.930
But that's why we've come to talk to her.

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:42.780
I must remind you that reuniting 
with that octo-woman—

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:46.810
that is, Lady Cthulhy—is not an 
excuse to get ahead of yourself.

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.630
I know, I know.

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:51.240
She's not interested in me anymore, anyway.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.670
I'm sure she's busy with work.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:05.250
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:28.000
Case 9        The Collapsed Dragon

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:29.380
Doctor, are you here? 
Saphentite and I are here to see you.

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:31.310
Come in.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:42.680
Ah, Glenn! I'm so happy you've come!

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:46.330
I'm glad you seem well yourself...

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:49.690
Lady Cthulhy! You failure of a mentor!

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:53.440
Would you kindly unwrap your 
filthy tentacles from him?

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:56.460
Oh, Saphentite. You're here, too?

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:57.840
You're welcome to leave now.

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:00.270
That is absolutely <i>not</i> happening!

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.080
Sapphee...

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:08.460
Glenn, you've aged a bit.

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:10.290
I'm sorry?

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:18.380
I've missed you, my sweet 
yet sassy little students.

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:22.270
Indeed, it has been some time, Lady Cthulhy.

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:27.220
I see that despite your old age, you still 
can't keep your tentacles off of young men.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:32.860
And I see that you're as 
wily and jealous as ever.

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:38.740
If only <i>someone</i> would stop meddling, I do 
believe my jealousy would be under control.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.860
Thank you for taking care of Skadi.

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:51.250
I was able to treat her immediately because 
you two arrived on the scene so quickly.

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:54.100
Since I couldn't attend the ceremony myself...

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.650
You just couldn't be bothered to make the trip.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:00.120
Doctor, what is ailing Lady Skadi?

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:05.300
It's quite serious.

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:08.810
As her primary physician, 
I can't reveal the details...

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.050
but it's a case so rare that I've 
never heard of another like it.

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:13.890
It's an extremely rare illness.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:15.350
A rare illness...

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:19.830
Her illness has already spread 
throughout her entire body.

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:23.900
It's a miracle that she's never 
collapsed in front of anyone before.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:28.080
She'll probably continue to have 
sudden, extreme fluctuations

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:31.000
in her blood pressure that could 
easily lead to heart failure.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:33.280
It's her heart?

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:36.080
Dragons are difficult to treat.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:39.150
Even when they have an illness that 
could kill other types of monsters,

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:41.870
they're highly resilient, 
so they don't die easily.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:45.210
And that just means they suffer even longer.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:51.650
This won't be easy to cure...

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:54.570
And, of course, it had to be 
a dragon with a rare disease.

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:56.330
Even I'll have my work cut out for me.

00:04:57.460 --> 00:05:00.070
This time, it was just a sudden 
drop in blood pressure,

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:03.440
so with some nourishment and rest, 
she'll wake up soon enough.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:07.840
But to cure her, we'll have to 
get to the root of the problem.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.530
So you're not even sure what's causing this?

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:13.530
No, that's actually quite obvious.

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:14.980
Because...

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:22.850
Now, head on back to your clinic, you two.

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:27.680
There's not much I can do unless 
Skadi changes her mind.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.560
What do you mean by that?

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:35.530
The biggest problem here is that Skadi 
has no interest in getting better.

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:40.320
I've told you enough. Go on home, now.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:44.950
It seems even Dr. Cthulhy is 
going to have her hands full.

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:49.640
Though, with all those tentacles, 
I suppose she can spare the hands.

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:50.810
Sapphee.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:55.880
The patient has no interest 
in getting better...

00:05:57.380 --> 00:06:02.180
It's true that the Draconness is 
saying she doesn't need treatment.

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:05.840
And Lady Cthulhy is respecting her wishes.

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:09.860
Therefore, she has no intention of staying 
at the hospital or receiving treatment.

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:12.600
She will also resume her duties 
as the representative tomorrow.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:16.350
There's no way this should 
be allowed to happen.

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:19.840
It's true that my mentor, Dr. Cthulhy,

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:22.740
probably wouldn't treat a 
patient if they refused it.

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:26.490
As a doctor, that's her way.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:30.150
I know she is your mentor, 
but you two are quite different.

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:34.040
Well, all I learned from her 
is knowledge and technique.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:36.780
My mentor is a scientist first and foremost.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:41.980
They are old friends. I'm sure there are 
things about them only they understand.

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:43.290
But still...

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:47.680
I have to repay her for taking me in.

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:51.330
I cannot just stand by as the 
Lady Draconness suffers!

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:54.430
Even if I have to defy her will, I—

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:59.670
I figured you'd say that, Miss Kunai.

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:02.270
That's actually why you 
came here today, isn't it?

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:07.230
Indeed. I'd like you to 
treat the Lady Draconness.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:12.520
You might be overstepping your 
bounds with Lady Cthulhy, though.

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:14.150
Heave-ho...

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:16.400
Don't worry. She's not the type 
to nag over things like that.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.400
Vroom.

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:18.650
First, we'll have to do an exam.

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:20.240
I'll make the arrangements.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:23.950
You would need to visit Lady Draconness's 
bedchamber back at the Council—

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:28.800
B-By "bedchamber," do you mean her bedroom?

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.580
W-Wait just a moment!

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:37.330
Are you suggesting that Dr. Glenn 
sneak into Lady Skadi's bedroom?

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:40.060
They would likely catch other 
people's eyes otherwise.

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:44.290
Besides, it'll be easier to examine 
her if she's wearing less clothing.

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:47.450
It would be a chore to get her 
usual robe and veil off of her.

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:53.640
You're going to sneak into the bedroom of 
Lady Skadi, a woman who looks like a child,

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.460
and undress her?!

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:57.900
There's no need to worry.

00:07:57.900 --> 00:08:00.880
I've been to other patients' homes before.

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:03.540
O-Of course you have.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:07.500
This is an exam, after all. 
Yes. That's all this is...

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:10.410
He's just... He's just doing his job.

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:12.270
It is most certainly <i>not</i> a tryst!

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:14.720
But wait, this is still...

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:15.910
However, Dr. Glenn,

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:18.840
if you're going to examine 
Lady Draconness's heart...

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:23.760
I'd like you to be prepared. 
It's beyond my imagination.

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:25.980
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:25.320
Her heart is?

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:31.570
I've explained the situation to the guards.

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:35.170
I haven't told Lady Draconness 
herself about this,

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:37.880
but I don't think she'll deny an examination.

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:38.820
That's great to hear.

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:46.640
Sorry, but I need Dr. Glenn 
to go on his own from here.

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:48.710
I-I'm going, too!

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:51.830
Especially if you're not 
joining him, Miss Kunai!

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:54.230
I need you to bear with 
me here, Miss Saphentite.

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:57.310
I'll be sure to jump in there 
if anything happens, though.

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:00.350
You understand, don't you, Dr. Glenn?

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:01.960
Y-Yes...

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:04.470
All right, I'm heading in.

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:30.870
Lady Skadi.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:50.640
Why are you here?

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:58.240
Miss Kunai asked me to examine you.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.230
I see.

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:02.530
Now I've caused Kunai trouble, as well.

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:05.080
I've worried her.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:09.630
There's always so little that 
I can do for those around me.

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:15.300
Dr. Glenn, I'm willing to overlook the 
fact that Kunai snuck into your clinic.

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.970
I will also settle for simply scolding Kunai.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:22.550
But since you had enough resolve 
to come here, I must also comply.

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:24.130
Then...

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:26.630
Yes. You may examine me.

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:31.020
Though I'm quite certain 
that you cannot cure me.

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:42.670
<i>It's an extremely rare illness.</i>

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:45.490
<i>It's beyond my imagination.</i>

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:51.020
<i>Even if the blue color is due to 
Lady Skadi's blood color, this is...</i>

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.680
May I touch it?

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:55.510
You may.

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:04.770
According to Cthulhy, 
this is a malignant tumor.

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:08.310
So it just resembles a heart?

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:09.540
Apparently so.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:13.920
It appears as though this tumor is slowly 
taking over all of the veins in my body.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:19.450
It has taken root, and changes 
the very circulation of my veins.

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:25.990
In other words... 
I currently have two hearts.

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:29.530
<i>That would place an extreme 
amount of stress on her body.</i>

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:33.200
<i>If she was a human or a normal 
monster, she'd be dead by now.</i>

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.600
This was bound to happen...

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:40.520
Because this is the fate that I have sown.

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:45.340
Dragons do not belong on the earth.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:50.610
Long ago, my ancestors came down to the earth 
from their place near the realm of the gods.

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:56.390
But they were affected by the earth's miasma, 
which changed their physical forms.

00:11:57.490 --> 00:12:00.240
Some lost their arms and legs, 
turning into wyrms.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:03.440
Some lost their arms and became wyverns.

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:06.990
Some in the East underwent 
an even greater transformation.

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:11.120
And some resembled humans, like myself.

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:15.920
I can never return to my 
former fire drake form.

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:21.450
So much blood was shed 
because of the great war...

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:26.140
All of those impurities 
must be stored in here...

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:30.530
I'm sure that's what has caused this illness...

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:35.620
Um, Dr. Glenn...

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:37.400
I'm sorry. Just a bit longer.

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:41.030
<i>I'm pretty sure this has nothing to do 
with impurities or the great war.</i>

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:45.770
<i>If this is truly a tumor, we should be 
able to track down its cause medically.</i>

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:51.860
So, Dr. Glenn, that is why I have no
intention of accepting treatment...

00:12:51.860 --> 00:12:53.410
I'm going to continue my examination.

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:55.850
Your scales seem to be...

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:58.250
That tickles!

00:12:58.630 --> 00:12:59.680
<i>They're hard.</i>

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:03.510
<i>If her tumor and veins are 
made from the same components,</i>

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:07.510
<i>it'd be difficult for a normal 
suture needle to even get through.</i>

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:08.620
Um...

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:09.580
Pardon me.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.800
I need to see this, too.

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:13.970
But that's...

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:16.320
Your tail is a different color.

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:21.670
Your tail was drooping during the ceremony.

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:23.940
You must've been forcing yourself.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:27.980
I can store nutrients in my tail...

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:30.850
So... when I'm not doing well,

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:33.410
my tail becomes thinner and hangs down more.

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:38.330
H-How long are you going to touch it?

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:40.400
I'm sorry, just a little bit longer.

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:44.500
Um... My tail is highly sensitive...

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:46.980
But I've seen you fight 
with your tail before.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.470
N-Not toward the base...

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:58.840
No... Um, my wings are especially...

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:02.360
I apologize. I just want to make 
sure nothing else is wrong.

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:10.190
I really can't... 
Dr. Glenn, please listen to...

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:23.710
Dr. Glenn! I heard Lady Draconness crying!

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:25.290
What in the world did you—

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:35.970
I was wondering what was taking so long...

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:40.470
Doctor, are you going to tell me that 
you're still examining her heart? Really?

00:14:40.470 --> 00:14:42.890
Huh? No, I...

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:45.040
Don't worry, I'll take pity on you.

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:48.110
I'll lop off your head so 
you won't feel a thing.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:49.110
Huh?!

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:52.410
I wonder if your infidelity will 
finally be cured once you're dead.

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:57.280
Wait a moment, Kunai.

00:14:57.280 --> 00:15:00.080
I'm fine. Really, I'm fine.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:02.160
L-Lady Draconness...

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:03.910
That should be enough.

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:05.830
The exam is now over.

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:08.990
I'm going to rest now.

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:21.570
So... what is it you want from me?

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:25.830
I'd like your help with Lady Skadi's surgery.

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:29.170
Well, if you went to the trouble of 
examining her, I'll leave the rest to you.

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:31.780
You and Saphentite can handle it.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.950
I know you're aware of this,

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.980
but her tumor is connecting itself 
to the major veins in her body

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:38.380
and pulsating.

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:41.460
To avoid a massive hemorrhage,

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:43.900
after we sever the connected veins,

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:47.470
we need to reconnect them to 
her actual heart immediately.

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:50.580
To make sure the patient 
doesn't become stressed,

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:52.750
we'll need to be fast and have 
as many hands as possible.

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:56.760
Since you have arms plus your tentacles, 
you could make this possible.

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:59.540
Doctor, please help me...

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:00.860
Thirty points.

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:05.290
Glenn, did you even get your 
patient to agree to this?

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:06.710
I'm going to convince her right now.

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:08.610
Come see me <i>after</i> you've convinced her.

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:12.820
Then if I'm able to convince 
her, will you help me?

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:18.940
Dr. Glenn, I'm sure Lady Cthulhy 
has her own reasons for...

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:22.830
I'll convince Lady Skadi, 
so I ask for your assistance.

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:26.200
You make it sound so simple, 
you foolish novice.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:31.160
Glenn, I'm sure you realize how 
difficult Skadi's surgery will be.

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:32.680
Of course.

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:34.850
That's no ordinary tumor.

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:42.350
That heart-shaped parasite has already taken 
control of over a hundred of Skadi's veins.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:45.690
Are you trying to imply you'd be 
able to take care of all of them?

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:47.980
I can, with your help—

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:49.990
If that were possible, 
I would've done it already!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:58.240
She... Skadi doesn't want to be treated.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:03.380
She's been selfishly saying she wants 
to find a place to die around here.

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:07.440
I've tried to convince her 
numerous times myself.

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:11.250
But that accursed, stubborn dragon girl...

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:19.130
Glenn.

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:22.170
Do you truly believe you 
can convince that girl?

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:24.380
I will.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:27.880
Why do you insist on going so far?

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:31.380
You haven't even known Skadi that long.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:33.420
You're right...

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:34.530
Then why?

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:38.750
Because no one wants to save Lady Skadi 
more than you do, Dr. Cthulhy.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:43.990
You want to save Lady Skadi 
more than anyone else.

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:46.550
That's why I came here.

00:17:47.050 --> 00:17:49.970
To save Lady Skadi alongside you.

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.580
You two...

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:59.340
What, again?

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:04.680
Wait! Me, too?

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:12.190
You two really have aged so much.

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:14.790
I-I'm still young, thank you very much!

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:16.680
Oh, no. You've definitely aged.

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:21.370
You've grown so unbelievably much 
since I taught you two at the academy.

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.360
Doctor...

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:26.830
Lady Cthulhy! Wait, where are you touching?!

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:31.340
Saphentite, I know I've 
caused you trouble, as well.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:34.790
Glenn's so young and reckless that 
I'm sure he's caused you trouble.

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:37.660
W-Wait... What do you think you're doing?

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:40.890
What am I doing? I'm praising you, of course.

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:56.280
But, Glenn,

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:59.420
even if we're to do the surgery, 
there'll be plenty of problems.

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:03.450
Even if Skadi agrees to this, 
we still don't have enough hands.

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:07.350
Right. I'll have Sapphee 
concentrate on the anesthesia

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:10.460
while someone else helps 
me with the operation.

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:13.650
We don't have much time 
to find that many people.

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:17.950
There's no one at this general hospital 
who can match your skill yet.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:19.720
Just one...

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:22.820
We just need one more capable person.

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:24.500
They don't have to be a doctor.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:27.460
Someone who's used to using thread 
and is good with their hands.

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:30.730
Someone who can match 
their rhythm with mine.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:33.370
Who could possibly fit 
all those requirements?

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:35.480
I have an idea.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:36.160
Huh?

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:38.850
I doubt she has any medical knowledge,

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:41.760
and there are parts of her personality 
I'm still not sure I understand...

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:43.550
But her skill is certain.

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:46.150
Doctor, you don't mean...

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:47.170
Yeah.

00:19:47.670 --> 00:19:49.660
I humbly decline.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:53.500
I could never pull somethin' like that off.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:58.820
I've explained the situation, and I've 
decided that you're perfect for this job.

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:00.900
Easy for you to say.

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:02.950
I heard he's a doctor.

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:04.920
Ooh, he's cute.

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:08.450
Humans are easy to catch, 
timid, and submissive.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.640
They're perfect marriage partners.

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:15.300
They're all just a bit randy 
after workin' all day.

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:18.410
No need to get all mad, Sapphee.

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:20.100
I'm not mad!

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:23.860
You get jealous over the tiniest things. 
You're so adorable, Sapphee.

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:26.160
Please, Miss Arahnia.

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:29.200
We'll guide you through 
every step of the surgery.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.580
Of course, I'll be taking 
all of the responsibility.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:36.220
You say that, but if I fail, 
what will the people in town think?

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:39.990
I might survive, but I'd be causin' 
this fine company some trouble.

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:41.620
Well...

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:46.430
I'm terribly sorry, but please 
find someone else to handle this.

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:48.610
Are you sure about this, Arahnia?

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:52.490
Until the surgery, 
you'd be staying at the clinic.

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:56.490
And as a part of the clinic, 
you'd be wearing this nurse's uniform.

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:01.680
We'd be matching. See?

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:03.240
Huh?

00:21:04.440 --> 00:21:05.440
I'm in!

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:07.980
Rather, I humbly accept!

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:09.240
Wha?

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:11.240
Looks like we've got a deal.

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:16.250
She was mostly putting up a front.

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:19.490
She was planning to accept from the start.

00:21:19.490 --> 00:21:20.540
What?

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:23.540
Though I doubt it was <i>all</i> a front...

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:28.310
But she may have some other goal 
in mind, so we should be on our guard.

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:30.500
Even if she does, she'll be a huge help.

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:35.960
But just as Dr. Cthulhy said, 
we'll have a lot to do before the surgery.

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:40.260
Convincing Lady Skadi, 
figuring out a precise plan of execution...

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:42.470
We'll also have to teach Arahnia a few things,

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:45.130
as well as continue our 
usual duties at the clinic.

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:47.770
We've truly agreed to a very difficult task.

00:21:48.850 --> 00:21:50.650
I guess I'll be causing you trouble again.

00:21:50.650 --> 00:21:55.390
No, I'll assist you in 
whatever you decide, Doctor.

00:21:56.260 --> 00:21:58.210
Thank you, Sapphee.

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
Case 10        The Self-Deprecating Cyclops

00:23:35.730 --> 00:23:39.300
Case 10: "The Self-Deprecating Cyclops."
